From d73f22cb0a8568fe7d829ac8cc9952bf21954f40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tyler Baker <tyler.baker@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:12:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] eliza: add the CQS EVK eMMC and UFS machine names

The Eliza CQS EVK device trees in qcom-next are split by boot storage
and carry the storage in their model string:

  eliza-cqs-evk-emmc.dts: "Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. Eliza CQS EVK (eMMC)"
  eliza-cqs-evk-ufs.dts:  "Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. Eliza CQS EVK (UFS)"

fastrpc matches /sys/firmware/devicetree/base/model exactly against
the conf.d machine names, so on these boards it finds no
DSP_LIBRARY_PATH and the audio PD searches only the current directory.
Any ADSP graph with a dynamically loaded module then fails to open,
e.g. the Fluence SMECNS capture graph on the eMMC EVK:

  apps_std_fopen_with_env_fd failed with 0x2 for
    ./smecns_v2_module_fvxiii.so.1 (No such file or directory)
  mod_table.c:911: Error 0x2: open_mod_table_handle_invoke failed
  gsl_graph_open_sgids_and_connections:3239 Graph open failed:1

Add both model strings as further machine names of the Eliza CQS EVK,
as done for the SA8775P Ride revisions; the mainline single EVK model
stays.

Rewritten for the 20261019 release, which still ships static conf.d
YAML files instead of generating them from config.txt.

Signed-off-by: Tyler Baker <tyler.baker@oss.qualcomm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 conf.d/hexagon-dsp-binaries-qualcomm-eliza-cqs-evk.yaml | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/conf.d/hexagon-dsp-binaries-qualcomm-eliza-cqs-evk.yaml b/conf.d/hexagon-dsp-binaries-qualcomm-eliza-cqs-evk.yaml
index 510275c..e7297f5 100644
--- a/conf.d/hexagon-dsp-binaries-qualcomm-eliza-cqs-evk.yaml
+++ b/conf.d/hexagon-dsp-binaries-qualcomm-eliza-cqs-evk.yaml
@@ -3,3 +3,7 @@
 machines:
   Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. Eliza CQS EVK :
     DSP_LIBRARY_PATH: eliza/Qualcomm/Eliza-CQS-EVK/dsp
+  Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. Eliza CQS EVK (eMMC):
+    DSP_LIBRARY_PATH: eliza/Qualcomm/Eliza-CQS-EVK/dsp
+  Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. Eliza CQS EVK (UFS):
+    DSP_LIBRARY_PATH: eliza/Qualcomm/Eliza-CQS-EVK/dsp
